This PR adds the following - 

- A new API `GET /api/v1/packages/summary` to get packages details along with releases and operation change summary. The API returns deleted packages as well in response.
- The functions involved DB calls from existing _Get Packages List_, _Get Versions_ and _Get Version Content_ APIs are reused wherever possible (or) replicated at places which require info related to deleted packages to be returned in response.
- This is an internal use API which requires _sys-admin_ privileges to be consumed by the consolidated report functionalities.

`GET /api/v1/packages/summary` API sample response - 

```
{
	"packages": [
		{
			"packageId": string,
			"name": string,
			"serviceName": string,
			"parentGroupName": string,
			"createdAt": time.Time,
			"deletedAt": time.Time,
			"versions": [
				{
					"version": string,
					"previousVersion": string,
					"status": string,
					"publishedAt": time.Time,
					"operationInfo": [
						{
							"apiType": string,
							"operationCount": int,
							"changeSummary": {
								"breaking": int,
								"semi-breaking": int,
								"deprecated": int,
								"non-breaking": int,
								"annotation": int,
								"unclassified": int
							}
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
```
